{"about_the_game":"Farm Invaders is a rogue-like shoot 'em up based on the Seraph's Last Stand, where in each run you select a character with unique abilities and try to survive while killing as many aliens as you can. Every wave you select an upgrade and try to win the game. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/PLAY.gif?t=1704827960\" /><br><br><br><strong>You start clean every playthrough, but if you choose the right combinations, you can snowballs into powerful builds:</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/UPGRADES.gif?t=1704827960\" /><br><br><strong>Multiple characters with unique abilities.</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/gif_character_selection.gif?t=1704827960\" /><br><br><strong>Play with friends.</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/gif_coop.gif?t=1704827960\" /><br><br><strong>Some features of the game are:</strong><br><br>- 40+ different items to compose your builds and secret items you discover by stacking.<br>- Multiple characters with unique abilities.<br>- 11 Ascensions.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2669300?t=1704827960","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1704827960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1704827960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1704827960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"descri